{
  "capturedAt": "2026-11-04T22:31:12.218Z",
  "url": "https://www.t-mobile.com/coverage/satellite-phone-service",
  "title": "T-Satellite: Direct to Cell Satellite Phone Service",
  "text": "Skip to main content\nPlans\nPlans\nPhones & devices\nPhones & devices\nDeals\nDeals\nCoverage\nCoverage\nJoin Us\nJoin Us\nFind a store\nContact & support\nContact & support\nCart\nSearch\nMy account\n\nmore from T-Mobile\n\nT-Satellite connects you where towers can’t.\n\nT-Satellite is the largest mobile + satellite network that keeps you connected where it wasn’t possible before. It activates automatically so you can use apps, text, voice chat, share locations, and more.\n\nIt comes with our best plans or can be added to other plans.\nYou don't even have to be a T-Mobile member to get it.\n\nGet T-Satellite\n\nTexting & select satellite-ready apps with compatible device in most outdoor areas in the U.S. where you can see the sky. Satellite service, including text to 911, may be delayed, limited, or unavailable. Included with Experience Beyond and Better Value plans or $10/mo.; auto renews monthly. Cancel anytime in T-Life App. Get full terms\n\nEXPAND YOUR COVERAGE\nNo cell signal?\nNo problem.\n\nNow you can use your devices in the over 500,000 miles of the U.S. that aren’t covered by any wireless company’s cell towers. Check out the T-Satellite coverage map.\n\nCONNECT AUTOMATICALLY\nWorks with most smartphones.\n\nT-Satellite works automatically on the majority of phones from the last four years. Learn if the phone you already have is supported.\n\nADVENTURE ABROAD\nT-Satellite is international.\n\nT-Satellite has your back in places towers can’t reach, in select countries with more destinations coming soon. Check out international destinations.\n\nT-Satellite: Texting and select satellite-ready apps with compatible device in most outdoor areas in the U.S. and select countries where you can see the sky. Satellite service, including 911 or emergency services, may be delayed, limited, or unavailable. Available with qualifying plans or $10/mo.; auto renews monthly. Cancel anytime. \nGet full terms\nWhat you can do with a T-Satellite connection:\nSend texts\n\nText and send photos with apps like iMessage and Google Messages, share locations, and contact emergency services.\n\nVoice chat\n\nUse WhatsApp to voice chat in places you couldn’t before when you’re connected to T-Satellite.\n\nUse select apps\n\nA growing suite of apps works with T-Satellite, so you can communicate, map your location, check weather, and much more. Check all current apps here.\n\nContact 911\n\nEveryone deserves peace of mind. With T-Mobile Text to 911 powered by T-Satellite, you can contact emergency services, even if you’re on another carrier.\n\nT-Mobile Text to 911 by Satellite supports text to 911 only and may be limited by coverage, delays, or location accuracy. See T-Mobile Terms & Conditions for details. \nGet full terms\nT-Satellite is included in our Experience Beyond plans.\n\nOr add it to any plan for $10/month per line.\n\nApps picked for you, optimized for T-Satellite:\n\n  WhatsApp\n\nWhatsApp + T-Satellite\n\n  AllTrails\n\nAllTrails + T-Satellite\n\n  X\n\nX + T-Satellite\n\n  AccuWeather\n\nAccuWeather + T-Satellite\n\n  Google Maps\n\nGoogle Maps + T-Satellite\n\nT-Life\n\nT-Life + T-Satellite\n\n  OnX\n\nOnX + T-Satellite\n\n  Overwatch x Rescue\n\nOverWatch x Rescue + T-Satellite\n\nTexting & select satellite-ready apps with compatible device in most outdoor areas in the U.S. where you can see the sky. Satellite service, including text to 911, may be delayed, limited, or unavailable. Included with Experience Beyond 2.0 plans or $10/mo.; auto renews monthly. Cancel anytime in T-Life App. Data speeds are limited and may not support all apps; performance varies and some apps may not function or may operate differently than on traditional cellular networks. Service may experience gaps or time-outs due to satellite coverage and network conditions. Unlimited use subject to these limitations.\n\nExplore all apps\nYou can get T-Satellite even if you’re not a member.\nJoin T-Mobile on an Experience Beyond plan.\n\nT-Satellite is included at no extra cost. Or join on another plan and add T-Satellite for just $10/month per line. You can switch in just 15 minutes.\n\nAdd T-Satellite to your current carrier’s plan.\n\nAdd it to your existing plan for just $10/month per line.\n\nGet emergency 911 access for free.\n\nAnyone with an eligible phone can use T-Mobile Text to 911 via satellite. You can register without a T-Mobile account.\n\nJoin T-Mobile\nT-Satellite makes off-the-grid connection easy.\n20-SECOND VIDEO\nYour phones works directly with satellites.\n\nYou’ll automatically connect to the nearest one.\n\n16-SECOND VIDEO\nYou don't have to change any settings—it just works.\n\nStart texting and using select apps like you normally would.\n\n25-SECOND VIDEO\nService depends on your location.\n\nA clear view of the sky gets you the best signal.\n\nHelp protect the places you love.\n\nWe are partnering with the National Park Foundation and committing $1 million to help protect our national parks. Join us by donating to preserve these incredible places so that more people can enjoy them for years to come.\n\nJoin us in donating\n, opens in a new window\nStay connected in outdoor areas where supported. \nGet full terms\nCoverage when and where you need it most.\nOutdoor adventuring.\n\nGet into nature without getting lost. Access real-time weather and road information, keep friends and family up to date on your location, and even contact emergency rescue services. \n\nRoad tripping.\n\nOff the grid doesn’t mean off the map. Check routes offline, locate points of interest beyond the beaten track, and get forecasts and weather alerts. \n\nStaying connected.\n\nKeep peace of mind wherever you roam. Share your live location with friends and family from almost anywhere, even when cell towers are nowhere in sight. \n\nNeed more assistance with T-Satellite?\n\nCheck out the FAQs below or our support page.\n\nGot questions?\nWhat can I do with T-Satellite?\nWhat’s satellite data?\nHow do I get T-Satellite and how much does it cost?\nDo I need a specific phone for T-Satellite?\nWhat do I need to do to connect to T-Satellite?\nWhere is T-Satellite coverage available?\nHow is this service different from traditional cellular networks?\nCan non-T-Mobile customers get T-Satellite?\nWhat is T-Mobile Text to 911 (T-911)?\nFollow T-Mobile\nInstagram\nFacebook\nX\nYou Tube\nChoose language\nEnglish\nEspañol\nEven more plans\nSenior phone plans\nInternational phone plans\nInternational passes\nHome Internet plans\nPhone and internet bundles\nHotspot data plans\nBusiness phone plans\nShop devices by brand\niPhones\niPads\nApple Watches\nGalaxy phones\nSamsung tablets\nSamsung watches\nMotorola phones\nGoogle Pixel phones\nNew featured cell phones\nNew Apple iPhone Duo\nNew Apple iPhone 18 Pro\nNew Apple iPhone 18 Pro Max\nNew Samsung Galaxy Z Fold8\nNew Google Pixel 11\nNew featured tablets, smartwatches & more\nApple iPad Mini (A17 Pro)\nApple iPad (A16)\nApple Watch SE 3 40mm\nT-Mobile Revvl Tab 2\nSamsung Galaxy Tab A11+ 5G\nSamsung Galaxy Watch Ultra2\nHelpful consumer guides\nDialed In\nCell Phone BYOD Guide\nThe 6 Best Samsung Phones of 2026\niPhone 18 Series: Specs, Price and Release Dates\nHow Does Satellite Phone Service Work?\nT-Mobile customer benefits\nTV streaming deals\nT-Mobile Tuesdays\nIn-flight wi-fi\nRefer-a-Friend\nDevice protection plan\nProtection 360® HomeTech\nSwitch to T-Mobile\nHow to switch to T-Mobile\nTry our 5G network\nBring your own device\nSwitch to T-Mobile from Verizon or AT&T\nFamily freedom deal\nCell phone trade-in\nAdditional support\nView return policy\nContact us\nBilling\nShipping & pickup options\nFree Internet for Students\nRedeem a rebate\nDomestic Violence Resources\nAbout T-Mobile\nOur Story\nT-Mobile careers\nPrivacy Center\nNewsroom\nCorporate Responsibility\nInstagram\nFacebook\nX\nYou Tube\nAbout\nInvestor relations\nPress\nCareers\nDeutsche Telekom\nPuerto Rico\nPrivacy Notice\nTrust Center\nPrivacy Center\nConsumer infor